spice
* SPICE Netlist for the given schematic

* Transistors
Q1 3 1 5 NPN
Q2 4 2 5 NPN

* Resistors
RC1 8 3 1k
RC2 8 4 1k

* Current Source
IQ 5 7 DC 1mA

* Voltage Source
